 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? It can get easier. Pick a restaurant and order for yourself, rather than sharing a plate with others. Do what makes you feel most at ease. If you like reading, bring a light one you've read before so you feel confident ordering. Great choice. They usually have lot of single dishes. Order a plate of their short grain rice and a side of pickled vegetables, and you' good to go. Wonderful. Order a pasta dish and some bread, and you can share the sauces. Then get a large bottle of water and maybe a small pastry.",
